  <h4> &#272;i&#7873;u Kho&#7843;n v&agrave; &#272;i&#7873;u Ki&#7879;n </h4>
  <p> Ch&agrave;o m&#7915;ng b&#7841;n &#273;&#7871;n v&#7899;i Chu&#7895;i an to&agrave;n th&#7921;c ph&#7849;m Vi&#7879;t Nam! </p>
  <p> C&aacute;c &#273;i&#7873;u kho&#7843;n v&agrave; &#273;i&#7873;u ki&#7879;n n&agrave;y li&#7879;t k&ecirc; c&aacute;c quy t&#7855;c v&agrave; quy &#273;&#7883;nh cho   vi&#7879;c s&#7917; d&#7909;ng trang web c&#7911;a VFTFARMS, &#273;&#7883;a ch&#7881; t&#7841;i https://vftfarms.com/. </p>
  <p> Khi b&#7841;n truy c&#7853;p trang web n&agrave;y, ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i hi&#7875;u r&#7857;ng b&#7841;n ch&#7845;p nh&#7853;n c&aacute;c   &#273;i&#7873;u kho&#7843;n v&agrave; &#273;i&#7873;u ki&#7879;n n&agrave;y. Kh&ocirc;ng ti&#7871;p t&#7909;c s&#7917; d&#7909;ng Chu&#7895;i an to&agrave;n th&#7921;c   ph&#7849;m Vi&#7879;t Nam n&#7871;u b&#7841;n kh&ocirc;ng &#273;&#7891;ng &yacute; th&#7921;c hi&#7879;n t&#7845;t c&#7843; c&aacute;c &#273;i&#7873;u kho&#7843;n v&agrave;   &#273;i&#7873;u ki&#7879;n &#273;&#432;&#7907;c n&ecirc;u tr&ecirc;n trang n&agrave;y. </p>
  <h4> Cookie: </h4>
  <p> Trang web s&#7917; d&#7909;ng cookie &#273;&#7875; gi&uacute;p c&aacute; nh&acirc;n h&oacute;a tr&#7843;i nghi&#7879;m tr&#7921;c tuy&#7871;n c&#7911;a   b&#7841;n. B&#7857;ng c&aacute;ch truy c&#7853;p v&agrave;o Chu&#7895;i an to&agrave;n th&#7921;c ph&#7849;m Vi&#7879;t Nam, b&#7841;n &#273;&atilde;   &#273;&#7891;ng &yacute; s&#7917; d&#7909;ng c&aacute;c cookie &#273;&#432;&#7907;c y&ecirc;u c&#7847;u. </p>
  <p> Cookie l&agrave; m&#7897;t t&#7879;p v&#259;n b&#7843;n &#273;&#432;&#7907;c m&aacute;y ch&#7911; trang web &#273;&#7863;t tr&ecirc;n &#273;&#297;a c&#7913;ng c&#7911;a   b&#7841;n. Cookie kh&ocirc;ng &#273;&#432;&#7907;c s&#7917; d&#7909;ng &#273;&#7875; ch&#7841;y ch&#432;&#417;ng tr&igrave;nh ho&#7863;c truy&#7873;n vi r&uacute;t   v&agrave;o m&aacute;y t&iacute;nh c&#7911;a b&#7841;n. Cookie &#273;&#432;&#7907;c ch&#7881; &#273;&#7883;nh duy nh&#7845;t cho b&#7841;n v&agrave; ch&#7881; c&oacute;   th&#7875; &#273;&#432;&#7907;c &#273;&#7885;c b&#7903;i m&aacute;y ch&#7911; web trong t&ecirc;n mi&#7873;n &#273;&atilde; c&#7845;p cookie cho b&#7841;n. </p>
  <p> Ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i c&oacute; th&#7875; s&#7917; d&#7909;ng cookie &#273;&#7875; thu th&#7853;p, l&#432;u tr&#7919; v&agrave; theo d&otilde;i th&ocirc;ng   tin cho c&aacute;c m&#7909;c &#273;&iacute;ch th&#7889;ng k&ecirc; ho&#7863;c ti&#7871;p th&#7883; &#273;&#7875; v&#7853;n h&agrave;nh trang web c&#7911;a   ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i. B&#7841;n c&oacute; th&#7875; ch&#7845;p nh&#7853;n ho&#7863;c t&#7915; ch&#7889;i Cookie. C&oacute; m&#7897;t s&#7889; Cookie   b&#7855;t bu&#7897;c c&#7847;n thi&#7871;t cho ho&#7841;t &#273;&#7897;ng c&#7911;a trang web c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i. Nh&#7919;ng   cookie n&agrave;y kh&ocirc;ng c&#7847;n s&#7921; &#273;&#7891;ng &yacute; c&#7911;a b&#7841;n v&igrave; ch&uacute;ng lu&ocirc;n ho&#7841;t &#273;&#7897;ng. Xin l&#432;u &yacute;   r&#7857;ng b&#7857;ng c&aacute;ch ch&#7845;p nh&#7853;n Cookie b&#7855;t bu&#7897;c, b&#7841;n c&#361;ng ch&#7845;p nh&#7853;n Cookie c&#7911;a   b&ecirc;n th&#7913; ba, c&oacute; th&#7875; &#273;&#432;&#7907;c s&#7917; d&#7909;ng th&ocirc;ng qua c&aacute;c d&#7883;ch v&#7909; do b&ecirc;n th&#7913; ba   cung c&#7845;p n&#7871;u b&#7841;n s&#7917; d&#7909;ng c&aacute;c d&#7883;ch v&#7909; &#273;&oacute; tr&ecirc;n trang web c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i,   ch&#7859;ng h&#7841;n nh&#432; c&#7917;a s&#7893; hi&#7875;n th&#7883; video do b&ecirc;n th&#7913; ba cung c&#7845;p v&agrave; &#273;&#432;&#7907;c t&iacute;ch   h&#7907;p v&agrave;o trang web c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i. </p>
  <h4> Gi&#7845;y ph&eacute;p: </h4>
  <p> Tr&#7915; khi c&oacute; quy &#273;&#7883;nh kh&aacute;c, VFTFARMS v&agrave;/ho&#7863;c ng&#432;&#7901;i c&#7845;p ph&eacute;p c&#7911;a n&oacute; s&#7903; h&#7919;u   quy&#7873;n s&#7903; h&#7919;u tr&iacute; tu&#7879; &#273;&#7889;i v&#7899;i t&#7845;t c&#7843; t&agrave;i li&#7879;u tr&ecirc;n Chu&#7895;i an to&agrave;n th&#7921;c   ph&#7849;m Vi&#7879;t Nam. T&#7845;t c&#7843; c&aacute;c quy&#7873;n s&#7903; h&#7919;u tr&iacute; tu&#7879; &#273;&#432;&#7907;c b&#7843;o l&#432;u. B&#7841;n c&oacute; th&#7875;   truy c&#7853;p v&agrave;o ph&#7847;n n&agrave;y t&#7915; Chu&#7895;i an to&agrave;n th&#7921;c ph&#7849;m Vi&#7879;t Nam cho m&#7909;c &#273;&iacute;ch   s&#7917; d&#7909;ng c&aacute; nh&acirc;n c&#7911;a ri&ecirc;ng b&#7841;n theo c&aacute;c h&#7841;n ch&#7871; &#273;&#432;&#7907;c &#273;&#7863;t ra trong c&aacute;c   &#273;i&#7873;u kho&#7843;n v&agrave; &#273;i&#7873;u ki&#7879;n n&agrave;y. </p>
  <p> B&#7841;n kh&ocirc;ng &#273;&#432;&#7907;c: </p>
  <ul>
    <li> Sao ch&eacute;p ho&#7863;c xu&#7845;t b&#7843;n l&#7841;i t&agrave;i li&#7879;u t&#7915; Chu&#7895;i an to&agrave;n th&#7921;c ph&#7849;m Vi&#7879;t Nam </li>
    <li> B&aacute;n, cho thu&ecirc; ho&#7863;c c&#7845;p ph&eacute;p l&#7841;i t&agrave;i li&#7879;u t&#7915; Chu&#7895;i an to&agrave;n th&#7921;c ph&#7849;m Vi&#7879;t Nam </li>
    <li> Sao ch&eacute;p, nh&acirc;n b&#7843;n ho&#7863;c sao ch&eacute;p t&agrave;i li&#7879;u t&#7915; Chu&#7895;i an to&agrave;n th&#7921;c ph&#7849;m Vi&#7879;t Nam </li>
    <li> Ph&acirc;n ph&#7889;i l&#7841;i n&#7897;i dung t&#7915; Chu&#7895;i an to&agrave;n th&#7921;c ph&#7849;m Vi&#7879;t Nam </li>
  </ul>
  <p> Th&#7887;a thu&#7853;n n&agrave;y s&#7869; b&#7855;t &#273;&#7847;u v&agrave;o ng&agrave;y c&#7911;a h&#7907;p &#273;&#7891;ng n&agrave;y. </p>
  <p> C&aacute;c ph&#7847;n c&#7911;a trang web n&agrave;y cung c&#7845;p cho ng&#432;&#7901;i d&ugrave;ng c&#417; h&#7897;i &#273;&#7875; &#273;&#259;ng v&agrave;   trao &#273;&#7893;i &yacute; ki&#7871;n &#8203;&#8203;v&agrave; th&ocirc;ng tin trong c&aacute;c l&#297;nh v&#7921;c nh&#7845;t &#273;&#7883;nh c&#7911;a trang   web. VFTFARMS kh&ocirc;ng l&#7885;c, ch&#7881;nh s&#7917;a, xu&#7845;t b&#7843;n ho&#7863;c xem x&eacute;t c&aacute;c b&igrave;nh lu&#7853;n   tr&#432;&#7899;c khi ch&uacute;ng hi&#7879;n di&#7879;n tr&ecirc;n trang web. C&aacute;c b&igrave;nh lu&#7853;n kh&ocirc;ng ph&#7843;n &aacute;nh   quan &#273;i&#7875;m v&agrave; &yacute; ki&#7871;n &#8203;&#8203;c&#7911;a VFTFARMS, c&aacute;c &#273;&#7841;i l&yacute; v&agrave;/ho&#7863;c affiliate c&#7911;a   VFTFARMS. B&igrave;nh lu&#7853;n ph&#7843;n &aacute;nh quan &#273;i&#7875;m v&agrave; &yacute; ki&#7871;n &#8203;&#8203;c&#7911;a ng&#432;&#7901;i &#273;&#259;ng b&igrave;nh   lu&#7853;n v&agrave; &yacute; ki&#7871;n &#8203;&#8203;c&#7911;a h&#7885;. Trong ph&#7841;m vi lu&#7853;t hi&#7879;n h&agrave;nh cho ph&eacute;p, VFTFARMS   s&#7869; kh&ocirc;ng ch&#7883;u tr&aacute;ch nhi&#7879;m v&#7873; b&igrave;nh lu&#7853;n ho&#7863;c b&#7845;t k&#7923; tr&aacute;ch nhi&#7879;m ph&aacute;p l&yacute;,   thi&#7879;t h&#7841;i ho&#7863;c chi ph&iacute; n&agrave;o g&acirc;y ra v&agrave;/ho&#7863;c ph&#7843;i g&aacute;nh ch&#7883;u do b&#7845;t k&#7923; vi&#7879;c   s&#7917; d&#7909;ng v&agrave;/ho&#7863;c &#273;&#259;ng v&agrave;/ho&#7863;c s&#7921; xu&#7845;t hi&#7879;n c&#7911;a b&igrave;nh lu&#7853;n tr&ecirc;n trang web   n&agrave;y. </p>
  <p> VFTFARMS c&oacute; quy&#7873;n gi&aacute;m s&aacute;t t&#7845;t c&#7843; c&aacute;c b&igrave;nh lu&#7853;n v&agrave; x&oacute;a b&#7845;t k&#7923; b&igrave;nh lu&#7853;n   n&agrave;o c&oacute; th&#7875; &#273;&#432;&#7907;c coi l&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng ph&ugrave; h&#7907;p, x&uacute;c ph&#7841;m ho&#7863;c vi ph&#7841;m c&aacute;c &#272;i&#7873;u   kho&#7843;n v&agrave; &#272;i&#7873;u ki&#7879;n n&agrave;y. </p>
  <p> B&#7841;n &#273;&#7843;m b&#7843;o v&agrave; tuy&ecirc;n b&#7889; r&#7857;ng: </p>
  <ul>
    <li> B&#7841;n c&oacute; quy&#7873;n &#273;&#259;ng b&igrave;nh lu&#7853;n tr&ecirc;n trang web c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i v&agrave; c&oacute; t&#7845;t c&#7843; c&aacute;c gi&#7845;y ph&eacute;p v&agrave; s&#7921; &#273;&#7891;ng &yacute; c&#7847;n thi&#7871;t &#273;&#7875; l&agrave;m nh&#432; v&#7853;y; </li>
    <li> C&aacute;c b&igrave;nh lu&#7853;n kh&ocirc;ng x&acirc;m ph&#7841;m b&#7845;t k&#7923; quy&#7873;n s&#7903; h&#7919;u tr&iacute; tu&#7879; n&agrave;o, bao g&#7891;m   nh&#432;ng kh&ocirc;ng gi&#7899;i h&#7841;n b&#7843;n quy&#7873;n, b&#7857;ng s&aacute;ng ch&#7871; ho&#7863;c nh&atilde;n hi&#7879;u c&#7911;a b&#7845;t k&#7923;   b&ecirc;n th&#7913; ba n&agrave;o; </li>
    <li> B&igrave;nh lu&#7853;n kh&ocirc;ng ch&#7913;a b&#7845;t k&#7923; t&agrave;i li&#7879;u ph&#7881; b&aacute;ng, b&ocirc;i nh&#7885;, x&uacute;c ph&#7841;m,   khi&#7871;m nh&atilde; ho&#7863;c b&#7845;t h&#7907;p ph&aacute;p n&agrave;o kh&aacute;c, l&agrave; s&#7921; x&acirc;m ph&#7841;m quy&#7873;n ri&ecirc;ng t&#432;. </li>
    <li> B&igrave;nh lu&#7853;n s&#7869; kh&ocirc;ng &#273;&#432;&#7907;c s&#7917; d&#7909;ng &#273;&#7875; thu h&uacute;t ho&#7863;c qu&#7843;ng b&aacute; kinh doanh   ho&#7863;c ho&#7841;t &#273;&#7897;ng t&ugrave;y ch&#7881;nh ho&#7863;c tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y c&aacute;c ho&#7841;t &#273;&#7897;ng th&#432;&#417;ng m&#7841;i ho&#7863;c   ho&#7841;t &#273;&#7897;ng b&#7845;t h&#7907;p ph&aacute;p. </li>
  </ul>
  <p> Theo &#273;&acirc;y, b&#7841;n c&#7845;p cho VFTFARMS gi&#7845;y ph&eacute;p kh&ocirc;ng &#273;&#7897;c quy&#7873;n &#273;&#7875; s&#7917; d&#7909;ng, t&aacute;i   t&#7841;o, ch&#7881;nh s&#7917;a v&agrave; cho ph&eacute;p ng&#432;&#7901;i kh&aacute;c s&#7917; d&#7909;ng, t&aacute;i t&#7841;o v&agrave; ch&#7881;nh s&#7917;a b&#7845;t   k&#7923; b&igrave;nh lu&#7853;n n&agrave;o c&#7911;a b&#7841;n &#7903; b&#7845;t k&#7923; v&agrave; t&#7845;t c&#7843; c&aacute;c h&igrave;nh th&#7913;c, &#273;&#7883;nh d&#7841;ng,   ho&#7863;c ph&#432;&#417;ng ti&#7879;n truy&#7873;n th&ocirc;ng. </p>
  <h4> Si&ecirc;u li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t &#273;&#7871;n N&#7897;i dung c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i: </h4>
  <p> C&aacute;c t&#7893; ch&#7913;c sau c&oacute; th&#7875; li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t &#273;&#7871;n trang web c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i m&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng c&#7847;n s&#7921; ch&#7845;p thu&#7853;n tr&#432;&#7899;c b&#7857;ng v&#259;n b&#7843;n: </p>
  <ul>
    <li> C&#417; quan ch&iacute;nh ph&#7911;; </li>
    <li> C&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng c&#7909; t&igrave;m ki&#7871;m; </li>
    <li> C&aacute;c t&#7893; ch&#7913;c tin t&#7913;c; </li>
    <li> C&aacute;c nh&agrave; ph&acirc;n ph&#7889;i danh b&#7841; tr&#7921;c tuy&#7871;n c&oacute; th&#7875; li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t &#273;&#7871;n trang web c&#7911;a   ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i theo c&aacute;ch t&#432;&#417;ng t&#7921; nh&#432; h&#7885; si&ecirc;u li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t &#273;&#7871;n trang web c&#7911;a c&aacute;c   doanh nghi&#7879;p &#273;&#432;&#7907;c li&#7879;t k&ecirc; kh&aacute;c; v&agrave; </li>
    <li> C&aacute;c Doanh nghi&#7879;p &#272;&#432;&#7907;c C&ocirc;ng nh&#7853;n tr&ecirc;n to&agrave;n h&#7879; th&#7889;ng ngo&#7841;i tr&#7915; vi&#7879;c k&ecirc;u   g&#7885;i c&aacute;c t&#7893; ch&#7913;c phi l&#7907;i nhu&#7853;n, c&aacute;c trung t&acirc;m mua s&#7855;m t&#7915; thi&#7879;n v&agrave; c&aacute;c   nh&oacute;m g&acirc;y qu&#7929; t&#7915; thi&#7879;n c&oacute; th&#7875; kh&ocirc;ng li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t v&#7899;i trang web c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i. </li>
  </ul>
  <p> C&aacute;c t&#7893; ch&#7913;c n&agrave;y c&oacute; th&#7875; li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t &#273;&#7871;n trang ch&#7911; c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i, &#273;&#7871;n c&aacute;c &#7845;n   ph&#7849;m, ho&#7863;c &#273;&#7871;n th&ocirc;ng tin trang web kh&aacute;c, mi&#7877;n l&agrave; li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t: (a) kh&ocirc;ng   l&#7915;a &#273;&#7843;o d&#432;&#7899;i b&#7845;t k&#7923; h&igrave;nh th&#7913;c n&agrave;o; (b) kh&ocirc;ng ng&#7909; &yacute; sai s&#7921; th&#7853;t v&#7873; vi&#7879;c   t&agrave;i tr&#7907;, ch&#7913;ng th&#7921;c ho&#7863;c ch&#7845;p thu&#7853;n cho b&ecirc;n li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t v&agrave; c&aacute;c s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m   v&agrave;/ho&#7863;c d&#7883;ch v&#7909; c&#7911;a b&ecirc;n li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t; v&agrave; (c) ph&ugrave; h&#7907;p v&#7899;i ng&#7919; c&#7843;nh c&#7911;a trang   web c&#7911;a b&ecirc;n li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t. </p>
  <p> Ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i c&oacute; th&#7875; xem x&eacute;t v&agrave; ch&#7845;p thu&#7853;n c&aacute;c y&ecirc;u c&#7847;u li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t kh&aacute;c t&#7915; c&aacute;c lo&#7841;i t&#7893; ch&#7913;c sau: </p>
  <ul>
    <li> c&aacute;c ngu&#7891;n th&ocirc;ng tin v&#7873; ng&#432;&#7901;i ti&ecirc;u d&ugrave;ng v&agrave;/ho&#7863;c doanh nghi&#7879;p th&#432;&#7901;ng &#273;&#432;&#7907;c bi&#7871;t &#273;&#7871;n; </li>
    <li> c&aacute;c trang web c&#7897;ng &#273;&#7891;ng dot.com; </li>
    <li> c&aacute;c hi&#7879;p h&#7897;i ho&#7863;c c&aacute;c nh&oacute;m kh&aacute;c &#273;&#7841;i di&#7879;n cho c&aacute;c t&#7893; ch&#7913;c t&#7915; thi&#7879;n; </li>
    <li> nh&agrave; ph&acirc;n ph&#7889;i danh b&#7841; tr&#7921;c tuy&#7871;n; </li>
    <li> c&#7893;ng th&ocirc;ng tin &#273;i&#7879;n t&#7917;; </li>
    <li> c&ocirc;ng ty k&#7871; to&aacute;n, lu&#7853;t v&agrave; t&#432; v&#7845;n; v&agrave; </li>
    <li> c&aacute;c t&#7893; ch&#7913;c gi&aacute;o d&#7909;c v&agrave; hi&#7879;p h&#7897;i th&#432;&#417;ng m&#7841;i. </li>
  </ul>
  <p> Ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i s&#7869; ch&#7845;p thu&#7853;n c&aacute;c y&ecirc;u c&#7847;u li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t t&#7915; c&aacute;c t&#7893; ch&#7913;c n&agrave;y n&#7871;u   ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i quy&#7871;t &#273;&#7883;nh r&#7857;ng: (a) li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t s&#7869; kh&ocirc;ng khi&#7871;n ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i c&oacute; c&aacute;i   nh&igrave;n b&#7845;t l&#7907;i &#273;&#7889;i v&#7899;i b&#7843;n th&acirc;n ho&#7863;c &#273;&#7889;i v&#7899;i c&aacute;c doanh nghi&#7879;p &#273;&#432;&#7907;c c&ocirc;ng   nh&#7853;n c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i; (b) t&#7893; ch&#7913;c kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; b&#7845;t k&#7923; h&#7891; s&#417; ti&ecirc;u c&#7921;c n&agrave;o v&#7899;i   ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i; (c) l&#7907;i &iacute;ch cho ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i t&#7915; kh&#7843; n&#259;ng hi&#7875;n th&#7883; c&#7911;a si&ecirc;u k&#7871;t   n&#7889;i b&ugrave; &#273;&#7855;p cho s&#7921; v&#7855;ng m&#7863;t c&#7911;a VFTFARMS; v&agrave; (d) li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t n&#7857;m trong ng&#7919;   c&#7843;nh c&#7911;a th&ocirc;ng tin t&agrave;i nguy&ecirc;n chung. </p>
  <p> C&aacute;c t&#7893; ch&#7913;c n&agrave;y c&oacute; th&#7875; li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t &#273;&#7871;n trang ch&#7911; c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i mi&#7877;n l&agrave;   li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t: (a) kh&ocirc;ng l&#7915;a &#273;&#7843;o d&#432;&#7899;i b&#7845;t k&#7923; h&igrave;nh th&#7913;c n&agrave;o; (b) kh&ocirc;ng ng&#7909; &yacute;   sai s&#7921; t&agrave;i tr&#7907;, ch&#7913;ng th&#7921;c ho&#7863;c ch&#7845;p thu&#7853;n c&#7911;a b&ecirc;n li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t v&agrave; c&aacute;c s&#7843;n   ph&#7849;m ho&#7863;c d&#7883;ch v&#7909; c&#7911;a b&ecirc;n li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t; v&agrave; (c) ph&ugrave; h&#7907;p v&#7899;i ng&#7919; c&#7843;nh c&#7911;a   trang web c&#7911;a b&ecirc;n li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t. </p>
  <p> N&#7871;u b&#7841;n l&agrave; m&#7897;t trong nh&#7919;ng t&#7893; ch&#7913;c &#273;&#432;&#7907;c li&#7879;t k&ecirc; trong ph&#7847;n 2 &#7903; tr&ecirc;n v&agrave;   mu&#7889;n li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t &#273;&#7871;n trang web c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i, b&#7841;n ph&#7843;i th&ocirc;ng b&aacute;o cho ch&uacute;ng   t&ocirc;i b&#7857;ng c&aacute;ch g&#7917;i e-mail &#273;&#7871;n VFTFARMS. Vui l&ograve;ng bao g&#7891;m t&ecirc;n c&#7911;a b&#7841;n, t&ecirc;n   t&#7893; ch&#7913;c c&#7911;a b&#7841;n, th&ocirc;ng tin li&ecirc;n h&#7879; c&#361;ng nh&#432; URL c&#7911;a trang web c&#7911;a b&#7841;n,   danh s&aacute;ch b&#7845;t k&#7923; URL n&agrave;o b&#7841;n &#273;&#7883;nh li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t &#273;&#7871;n trang web c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i   v&agrave; danh s&aacute;ch c&aacute;c URL tr&ecirc;n trang web c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i m&agrave; b&#7841;n mu&#7889;n li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t.   Ch&#7901; 2-3 tu&#7847;n &#273;&#7875; c&oacute; ph&#7843;n h&#7891;i. </p>
  <p> C&aacute;c t&#7893; ch&#7913;c &#273;&#432;&#7907;c ch&#7845;p thu&#7853;n c&oacute; th&#7875; si&ecirc;u li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t &#273;&#7871;n trang web c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i nh&#432; sau: </p>
  <ul>
    <li> B&#7857;ng c&aacute;ch s&#7917; d&#7909;ng t&ecirc;n c&ocirc;ng ty c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i; ho&#7863;c </li>
    <li> B&#7857;ng c&aacute;ch s&#7917; d&#7909;ng b&#7897; &#273;&#7883;nh v&#7883; t&agrave;i nguy&ecirc;n th&#7889;ng nh&#7845;t &#273;&#432;&#7907;c li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t v&#7899;i; ho&#7863;c l&agrave; </li>
    <li> S&#7917; d&#7909;ng b&#7845;t k&#7923; m&ocirc; t&#7843; n&agrave;o kh&aacute;c v&#7873; Trang web c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i &#273;&#432;&#7907;c li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t   v&#7899;i &#273;i&#7873;u &#273;&oacute; c&oacute; &yacute; ngh&#297;a trong ng&#7919; c&#7843;nh v&agrave; &#273;&#7883;nh d&#7841;ng n&#7897;i dung tr&ecirc;n trang   web c&#7911;a b&ecirc;n li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t. </li>
  </ul>
  <p> Kh&ocirc;ng &#273;&#432;&#7907;c ph&eacute;p s&#7917; d&#7909;ng logo c&#7911;a VFTFARMS ho&#7863;c t&aacute;c ph&#7849;m ngh&#7879; thu&#7853;t kh&aacute;c &#273;&#7875; li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t m&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; th&#7887;a thu&#7853;n c&#7845;p ph&eacute;p nh&atilde;n hi&#7879;u. </p>
  <h4> Tr&aacute;ch Nhi&#7879;m v&#7873; N&#7897;i Dung: </h4>
  <p> Ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i s&#7869; kh&ocirc;ng ch&#7883;u tr&aacute;ch nhi&#7879;m v&#7873; b&#7845;t k&#7923; n&#7897;i dung n&agrave;o xu&#7845;t hi&#7879;n   tr&ecirc;n trang web c&#7911;a b&#7841;n. B&#7841;n &#273;&#7891;ng &yacute; b&#7843;o v&#7879; v&agrave; b&#7843;o v&#7879; ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i tr&#432;&#7899;c t&#7845;t   c&#7843; c&aacute;c khi&#7871;u n&#7841;i &#273;&#432;&#7907;c &#273;&#432;a ra tr&ecirc;n trang web c&#7911;a b&#7841;n. Kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; (c&aacute;c) li&ecirc;n   k&#7871;t s&#7869; xu&#7845;t hi&#7879;n tr&ecirc;n b&#7845;t k&#7923; trang web n&agrave;o c&oacute; th&#7875; &#273;&#432;&#7907;c hi&#7875;u l&agrave; b&ocirc;i nh&#7885;,   t&#7909;c t&#297;u ho&#7863;c t&#7897;i ph&#7841;m, ho&#7863;c vi ph&#7841;m, b&#7841;o l&#7921;c, ho&#7863;c &#7911;ng h&#7897; vi&#7879;c vi ph&#7841;m   c&aacute;c vi ph&#7841;m kh&aacute;c, b&#7845;t k&#7923; quy&#7873;n n&agrave;o thu&#7897;c v&#7873; b&ecirc;n th&#7913; ba. </p>
  <h4> Quy&#7873;n &#272;&#432;&#7907;c B&#7843;o L&#432;u: </h4>
  <p> Ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i c&oacute; quy&#7873;n y&ecirc;u c&#7847;u b&#7841;n x&oacute;a t&#7845;t c&#7843; c&aacute;c li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t ho&#7863;c b&#7845;t k&#7923; li&ecirc;n   k&#7871;t c&#7909; th&#7875; n&agrave;o &#273;&#7871;n trang web c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i. B&#7841;n ch&#7845;p thu&#7853;n x&oacute;a ngay l&#7853;p   t&#7913;c t&#7845;t c&#7843; c&aacute;c li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t &#273;&#7871;n trang web c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i theo y&ecirc;u c&#7847;u. Ch&uacute;ng   t&ocirc;i c&#361;ng c&oacute; quy&#7873;n s&#7917;a &#273;&#7893;i c&aacute;c &#273;i&#7873;u kho&#7843;n v&agrave; &#273;i&#7873;u ki&#7879;n n&agrave;y v&agrave; ch&iacute;nh s&aacute;ch   li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t c&#7911;a n&oacute; b&#7845;t k&#7923; l&uacute;c n&agrave;o. B&#7857;ng c&aacute;ch li&ecirc;n t&#7909;c li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t &#273;&#7871;n trang   web c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i, b&#7841;n &#273;&#7891;ng &yacute; b&#7883; r&agrave;ng bu&#7897;c v&agrave; tu&acirc;n theo c&aacute;c &#273;i&#7873;u kho&#7843;n   v&agrave; &#273;i&#7873;u ki&#7879;n li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t n&agrave;y. </p>
  <h4> X&oacute;a c&aacute;c li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t t&#7915; trang web c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i: </h4>
  <p> N&#7871;u b&#7841;n t&igrave;m th&#7845;y b&#7845;t k&#7923; li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t n&agrave;o tr&ecirc;n trang web c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i g&acirc;y   kh&oacute; ch&#7883;u v&igrave; b&#7845;t k&#7923; l&yacute; do g&igrave;, b&#7841;n c&oacute; th&#7875; li&ecirc;n h&#7879; v&agrave; th&ocirc;ng b&aacute;o cho ch&uacute;ng   t&ocirc;i b&#7845;t c&#7913; l&uacute;c n&agrave;o. Ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i s&#7869; xem x&eacute;t c&aacute;c y&ecirc;u c&#7847;u x&oacute;a li&ecirc;n k&#7871;t, nh&#432;ng   ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; ngh&#297;a v&#7909; ph&#7843;i tr&#7843; l&#7901;i b&#7841;n tr&#7921;c ti&#7871;p. </p>
  <p> Ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i kh&ocirc;ng &#273;&#7843;m b&#7843;o r&#7857;ng th&ocirc;ng tin tr&ecirc;n trang web n&agrave;y l&agrave; ch&iacute;nh x&aacute;c.   Ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i kh&ocirc;ng &#273;&#7843;m b&#7843;o t&iacute;nh &#273;&#7847;y &#273;&#7911; ho&#7863;c ch&iacute;nh x&aacute;c c&#7911;a n&oacute;, c&#361;ng nh&#432;   kh&ocirc;ng h&#7913;a &#273;&#7843;m b&#7843;o r&#7857;ng trang web v&#7851;n c&oacute; s&#7861;n ho&#7863;c t&agrave;i li&#7879;u tr&ecirc;n trang web   &#273;&#432;&#7907;c c&#7853;p nh&#7853;t. </p>
  <h4> Tuy&ecirc;n b&#7889; t&#7915; ch&#7889;i tr&aacute;ch nhi&#7879;m: </h4>
  <p> Trong ph&#7841;m vi t&#7889;i &#273;a &#273;&#432;&#7907;c lu&#7853;t ph&aacute;p hi&#7879;n h&agrave;nh cho ph&eacute;p, ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i lo&#7841;i   tr&#7915; t&#7845;t c&#7843; c&aacute;c tuy&ecirc;n b&#7889;, &#273;&#7843;m b&#7843;o v&agrave; &#273;i&#7873;u ki&#7879;n li&ecirc;n quan &#273;&#7871;n trang web   c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i v&agrave; vi&#7879;c s&#7917; d&#7909;ng trang web n&agrave;y. Kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; n&#7897;i dung n&agrave;o trong   tuy&ecirc;n b&#7889; t&#7915; ch&#7889;i tr&aacute;ch nhi&#7879;m n&agrave;y s&#7869;: </p>
  <ul>
    <li> gi&#7899;i h&#7841;n ho&#7863;c lo&#7841;i tr&#7915; tr&aacute;ch nhi&#7879;m ph&aacute;p l&yacute; c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i ho&#7863;c c&#7911;a b&#7841;n &#273;&#7889;i v&#7899;i tr&#432;&#7901;ng h&#7907;p t&#7917; vong ho&#7863;c th&#432;&#417;ng t&iacute;ch c&aacute; nh&acirc;n; </li>
    <li> gi&#7899;i h&#7841;n ho&#7863;c lo&#7841;i tr&#7915; tr&aacute;ch nhi&#7879;m ph&aacute;p l&yacute; c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i ho&#7863;c c&#7911;a b&#7841;n &#273;&#7889;i v&#7899;i gian l&#7853;n ho&#7863;c tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y sai s&#7921; th&#7853;t; </li>
    <li> gi&#7899;i h&#7841;n b&#7845;t k&#7923; tr&aacute;ch nhi&#7879;m ph&aacute;p l&yacute; n&agrave;o c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i ho&#7863;c c&#7911;a b&#7841;n   theo b&#7845;t k&#7923; c&aacute;ch n&agrave;o kh&ocirc;ng &#273;&#432;&#7907;c ph&aacute;p lu&#7853;t hi&#7879;n h&agrave;nh cho ph&eacute;p; ho&#7863;c </li>
    <li> lo&#7841;i tr&#7915; b&#7845;t k&#7923; tr&aacute;ch nhi&#7879;m ph&aacute;p l&yacute; n&agrave;o c&#7911;a ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i ho&#7863;c c&#7911;a b&#7841;n c&oacute; th&#7875; kh&ocirc;ng b&#7883; lo&#7841;i tr&#7915; theo lu&#7853;t hi&#7879;n h&agrave;nh. </li>
  </ul>
  <p> C&aacute;c gi&#7899;i h&#7841;n v&agrave; c&#7845;m tr&aacute;ch nhi&#7879;m ph&aacute;p l&yacute; &#273;&#432;&#7907;c quy &#273;&#7883;nh trong ph&#7847;n n&agrave;y v&agrave;   c&aacute;c ph&#7847;n kh&aacute;c trong tuy&ecirc;n b&#7889; t&#7915; ch&#7889;i tr&aacute;ch nhi&#7879;m n&agrave;y: (a) tu&acirc;n theo   kho&#7843;n tr&ecirc;n; v&agrave; (b) chi ph&#7889;i t&#7845;t c&#7843; c&aacute;c tr&aacute;ch nhi&#7879;m ph&aacute;p l&yacute; ph&aacute;t sinh   theo tuy&ecirc;n b&#7889; t&#7915; ch&#7889;i tr&aacute;ch nhi&#7879;m, bao g&#7891;m c&#7843; tr&aacute;ch nhi&#7879;m ph&aacute;p l&yacute; ph&aacute;t   sinh trong h&#7907;p &#273;&#7891;ng, vi ph&#7841;m ngh&#297;a v&#7909; theo lu&#7853;t &#273;&#7883;nh. </p>
  <p> Mi&#7877;n l&agrave; trang web v&agrave; th&ocirc;ng tin v&agrave; d&#7883;ch v&#7909; tr&ecirc;n trang web &#273;&#432;&#7907;c cung c&#7845;p   mi&#7877;n ph&iacute;, ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i s&#7869; kh&ocirc;ng ch&#7883;u tr&aacute;ch nhi&#7879;m v&#7873; b&#7845;t k&#7923; t&#7893;n th&#7845;t ho&#7863;c   thi&#7879;t h&#7841;i n&agrave;o d&#432;&#7899;i b&#7845;t k&#7923; h&igrave;nh th&#7913;c n&agrave;o. </p>
